Package: mirageV2
Title: Mixture Model Based Rare Variant Analysis on Genes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anson", "Li", email = "liyuanrui618@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Shengtong", "Han", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Gene-level and variant-set rare-variant association tests using the
    MIRAGE mixture model (Han et al. (2025), <https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41421362>).
    Bayes factors are integrated in C++ and the EM fit is done in log-space.
    A high-performance rewrite of the GitHub package 'mirage', with input checks
    and S3 methods for printing, summarizing, and tidying results. Bundled toy datasets
    are derived from the BSD-3-Clause licensed 'mirage' package;
    see inst/COPYRIGHTS for the original license text.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
